msgstr "Processes"

#: src/content/glossary.ts
msgid "Ballot proof"
msgstr "Ballot proof"

#: src/content/glossary.ts
msgid "A proof, made by the voting app, that the encrypted ballot follows the rules. It does not reveal what the ballot says."
msgstr "A proof, made by the voting app, that the encrypted ballot follows the rules. It does not reveal what the ballot says."

#: src/content/glossary.ts
msgid "A Groth16 proof, of the davinci-circom ballot circuit, that a ballot is a correct encryption for the process. Its public inputs are the voter’s address, the vote id and an inputs hash over the process id, the ballot mode, the key, the voter’s address, the vote id, the ciphertexts and the weight."
msgstr "A Groth16 proof, of the davinci-circom ballot circuit, that a ballot is a correct encryption for the process. Its public inputs are the voter’s address, the vote id and an inputs hash over the process id, the ballot mode, the key, the voter’s address, the vote id, the ciphertexts and the weight."

#: src/content/glossary.ts
msgid "Ballot VK hash"
msgstr "Ballot VK hash"

#: src/content/glossary.ts
msgid "The fingerprint of the key that checks ballot proofs. The registry fixes it, so every election checks ballots the same way."
msgstr "The fingerprint of the key that checks ballot proofs. The registry fixes it, so every election checks ballots the same way."

#: src/content/glossary.ts
msgid "sha256 of the ballot proof’s verification key: a registry immutable, written into every genesis state as leaf `0x07`. The guest hashes the key it is given and only accepts ballot proofs under a key with this hash."
msgstr "sha256 of the ballot proof’s verification key: a registry immutable, written into every genesis state as leaf `0x07`. The guest hashes the key it is given and only accepts ballot proofs under a key with this hash."

