msgstr "The program verification key of the vote-batch guest (`circuit/elf/circuit.elf` in davinci-zkvm): the root hash `cargo-zisk setup` prints for it. `submitStateTransition` verifies every batch proof against it, and the verifier hashes it into the proof’s public input, so only a proof of this exact program settles a transition."

#: src/pages/contracts/model.ts
msgid "Batches of votes would be checked by a program other than the released one, so none of the checks the released program makes could be taken for granted."
msgstr "Batches of votes would be checked by a program other than the released one, so none of the checks the released program makes could be taken for granted."

