msgid "A process page’s overview shows what kind of list of voters the election uses, the list’s fingerprint (its census root) and its address. Every batch page checks the list its proof used against the lists the election accepts."
msgstr "A process page’s overview shows what kind of list of voters the election uses, the list’s fingerprint (its census root) and its address. Every batch page checks the list its proof used against the lists the election accepts."

#: src/pages/learn/content/Census.tsx
msgid "The list of voters of the newest election"
msgstr "The list of voters of the newest election"

#: src/pages/learn/content/Census.tsx
msgid "Every process, filterable by the kind of list of voters"
msgstr "Every process, filterable by the kind of list of voters"

#: src/pages/learn/content/Glossary.tsx
msgid "Each word has a plain definition first, the one a dotted word shows on hover anywhere in the explorer, and the exact one below it, with the names and formulas an auditor needs."
msgstr "Each word has a plain definition first, the one a dotted word shows on hover anywhere in the explorer, and the exact one below it, with the names and formulas an auditor needs."

#: src/pages/learn/content/Glossary.tsx
#: src/pages/learn/content/Glossary.tsx
