msgstr "After voting ends, the key holder decrypts the <0>encrypted total</0>, proves that the results are right and publishes them."

#: src/pages/process/tabs/KeyTab.tsx
msgid "The key holder could read every ballot in the published data, and nobody else can publish the results. This mode trusts one party with ballot secrecy."
msgstr "The key holder could read every ballot in the published data, and nobody else can publish the results. This mode trusts one party with ballot secrecy."

#: src/pages/process/tabs/KeyTab.tsx
msgid "The organizer supplied the key at creation, normally one it got from a sequencer node (<0>POST /processes/keys</0>). That node derives the secret from its master secret and the process id and never stores it. After the end, the key holder decrypts the final accumulator (the encrypted sum of all ballots), proves the tally with the zkVM results program and publishes it with <1>setProcessResults</1>."
msgstr "The organizer supplied the key at creation, normally one it got from a sequencer node (<0>POST /processes/keys</0>). That node derives the secret from its master secret and the process id and never stores it. After the end, the key holder decrypts the final accumulator (the encrypted sum of all ballots), proves the tally with the zkVM results program and publishes it with <1>setProcessResults</1>."

#: src/pages/process/tabs/KeyTab.tsx
msgid "A <0>key committee</0> holds the key in shares. No sequencer and no organizer knows the secret, and no member knows it alone."
msgstr "A <0>key committee</0> holds the key in shares. No sequencer and no organizer knows the secret, and no member knows it alone."

#: src/pages/process/tabs/KeyTab.tsx
msgid "After voting ends, the encrypted total goes to the committee and enough members together decrypt it. They decrypt only that final total, never a single ballot."
msgstr "After voting ends, the encrypted total goes to the committee and enough members together decrypt it. They decrypt only that final total, never a single ballot."

#: src/pages/process/tabs/KeyTab.tsx
msgid "Enough members of the committee colluding (a <0>threshold</0> of them) could read every ballot. If so many members leave before the end that fewer than the threshold remain, the results are lost."
msgstr "Enough members of the committee colluding (a <0>threshold</0> of them) could read every ballot. If so many members leave before the end that fewer than the threshold remain, the results are lost."

#: src/pages/process/tabs/KeyTab.tsx
msgid "The key is one pool key of a davinci-dkg committee epoch; each committee member holds one share of its secret. After the end, anyone can send the final accumulator to the committee (<0>requestResultsDecryption</0>); sequencers do it on their first heartbeat after the end. A threshold of members post partial decryptions, each with a Groth16 proof, and a combine yields each field’s total. The committee never reconstructs the secret. With n members and a threshold t, losing more than <1/> members before the end loses the results."
msgstr "The key is one pool key of a davinci-dkg committee epoch; each committee member holds one share of its secret. After the end, anyone can send the final accumulator to the committee (<0>requestResultsDecryption</0>); sequencers do it on their first heartbeat after the end. A threshold of members post partial decryptions, each with a Groth16 proof, and a combine yields each field’s total. The committee never reconstructs the secret. With n members and a threshold t, losing more than <1/> members before the end loses the results."

#: src/pages/process/tabs/KeyTab.tsx
msgid "A committee key plus a secret the organizer keeps (the <0>organizer secret</0>). Neither can decrypt without the other."
msgstr "A committee key plus a secret the organizer keeps (the <0>organizer secret</0>). Neither can decrypt without the other."

#: src/pages/process/tabs/KeyTab.tsx
msgid "The committee can decrypt the encrypted total only after the organizer reveals the organizer secret. The organizer decides when the results appear, not what they are."
msgstr "The committee can decrypt the encrypted total only after the organizer reveals the organizer secret. The organizer decides when the results appear, not what they are."

#: src/pages/process/tabs/KeyTab.tsx
