msgstr "The <0>encrypted total</0> after this batch (the accumulator), one encrypted value per ballot field: the previous total, plus every new ballot, minus the ballots they replaced, plus the silent refreshes’ encryptions of zero, which change no result. Only the final total is decrypted, when the results are published. The key holder could decrypt this one, or any ballot in the published data."

