msgstr "Run your own copy of the sequencer software without a signing key, as an <0>observer</0>. It follows every election, downloads each batch’s data, rebuilds the state on your computer and accepts a batch only if it reaches the same fingerprint as the chain. That checks every batch, whoever sent it."

