msgstr "<0>setProcessStatus</0>: from Ready or Paused, to Paused, Ready, Canceled or Ended. Pausing stops batches from being recorded but not the clock; votes can still queue at a sequencer and be recorded after you resume. Ending by hand also shortens the duration to the time elapsed. Canceled and Results are final."

#: src/pages/verify/election/index.tsx
msgid "<0>setProcessDuration</0>: only longer, while Ready or Paused and before the current end."
msgstr "<0>setProcessDuration</0>: only longer, while Ready or Paused and before the current end."

